{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不只想靠近，也想被对方同样珍惜，还想有机会好好关心对方，看看两个人能一起过怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时不再因想被珍惜而自责，眼前的亲近和想对对方好的心思让他顾不上自己的得失。\",\n      \"key\": \"顾不上自己的得失\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得自己有许多爱可以给，眼前的亲近和心里的喜欢都值得珍惜，一时觉得想要的生活仿佛就在眼前。可对方没给新保证，他仍盼着对方也选择自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"想要的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近让他暂时顾不上追问两个人以后会怎样，只想让这阵欢喜多留一会儿。等欢喜稍退，他想知道对方是否也会选择自己的念头又会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R51\",\n        \"R52\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并重复的想靠近，具体写出他想被同样珍惜、想关心对方，也想看看两人能一起过怎样的日子。承接前段不再因想被珍惜而怀疑真心的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R53\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再抽象宣布缺憾暂时不折磨他，而是写出他一时不再为想被珍惜自责，并因眼前的亲近和想对对方好而顾不上自身得失，解释狂喜中自我暂时退后的感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R54\",\n        \"R55\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留正面的丰盈感：他有许多爱可以给，眼前的亲近和心里的喜欢都值得珍惜，想要的生活一时仿佛就在眼前。同时保留对方没有新保证、他仍盼着被选择的事实，说明愿望得到承认不等于愿望已经实现，也解释满足中仍有牵扯。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R56\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂时顾不上未来、想让欢喜多留一会儿，以及欢喜稍退后期待重新浮现的意思。用眼前的亲近解释他为何暂不追问以后，去掉幸福完整地停留的抽象说法。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a4d367d7-d6df-4598-850e-be6f1e59284f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223649699653Z", "elapsed_seconds": 305.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:41:55.218107+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73a7fd578a74aecfed4db673cff746cd0a39d4710afccbe343e426b7e0c82d91", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool